  "prefLabel": "Lot 900 RULES OF LOTTERY INTERCEPT",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Lot 900 RULES OF LOTTERY INTERCEPT\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 284:21-v\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nPursuant to 2004, 97:1-9, effective 7-10-04, the Sweepstakes Commission was renamed the Lottery Commission. The rules filed in Chapter Sw 900 by the Sweepstakes Commission before 7-10-04 and by the Lottery Commission after 7-10-04 reflected the title “Sw” of the former Sweepstakes Commission. They were editorially renumbered as Chapter Lot 900 in November, 2020 to indicate rules of the Lottery Commission.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot900.html"
